            This directory contains modified versions of the upstream files.

Removed from upstream: Demo/, Tests/, media/, .github/, .spi.yml, CONTRIBUTING.md,
the MarkdownEngineCodeBlocks and MarkdownEngineLatex targets (and their
HighlighterSwift / SwiftMath dependencies). Package.swift lists only MarkdownEngine.
The upstream test suite (532 tests) passed against the modified sources with all
new switches at their defaults.

Changes by Marc (all marked with `// Marc:` or in files starting with a Marc comment):

1. NativeTextViewWrapper: new public hooks and init parameters
   - onTextViewReady: ((NSTextView) -> Void)?   (async on main queue after creation)
   - onWillPaste: ((NSTextView, NSPasteboard) -> Bool)?
   - onDropFiles: ((NSTextView, NSDraggingInfo, Int) -> Bool)?   (Int = UTF-16 insertion index)
   - onSaveRequest: ((NSTextView) -> Bool)?   (the `saveDocument:` action)
2. NativeTextView+PasteHandling: paste(_:) calls onWillPaste first. pasteAsPlainText(_:)
   (⌥⇧⌘V) is overridden: it inserts the plain-text flavor and bypasses onWillPaste and the
   engine's HTML conversion. validateUserInterfaceItem accepts saveDocument:.
3. NativeTextView+FileDrop.swift (new): registers .fileURL drag type, calls onDropFiles
   from performDragOperation; false falls back to AppKit's default.
4. NativeTextView+SaveRequest.swift (new): `saveDocument:` responder that calls
   onSaveRequest, else forwards to the next responder (the NSDocument).
5. Services/FileImageProvider.swift (new): EmbeddedImageProvider that resolves
   `![x](relative/path.png)` against a base directory URL (also absolute paths, file: URLs,
   `<...>` destinations, titles, percent escapes). Set via configuration.services.images.
6. Configuration/MarkdownEngineFeatures.swift (new): global switches wikiLinks, imageEmbeds,
   latex, arrowSubstitution (defaults true = upstream behavior). disableNonGFM() turns all off.
   Used in InlineParser.matchBuiltIn, BlockParser.isBlockLatexOpen, WikiLinkService
   (display text == raw text when off), MarkdownListHandler (no `[[` completion, no `->` arrow).
7. Extensions (==highlight==) and directives (@name) are already off by default upstream
   (empty `configuration.extensions` / `.directives`); Marc registers only StrikethroughExtension.
8. Key bindings: the engine binds none of the shortcuts Marc uses (checked: it has no
   key-equivalent or menu code besides ⌘↵ for wiki previews, which is inert with wiki links off).
   Nothing had to be removed.
9. NativeTextViewWrapper.updateNSView: configuration.paragraph (line height extra spacing,
   paragraph spacing) is synced at runtime and triggers a rebuild like a font change.
   Upstream only applied it in makeNSView.
10. NativeTextView+FrameAndOverscroll: scrollRangeToVisible uses the engine's explicit reveal in
   full-width mode too (upstream: reading column only). Native NSTextView reveal does not scroll
   through the NativeTextViewContainer document view, so arrow keys did not scroll the document.
